    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Welcome to the AI Website Chatbot with Memory!\n\nBefore running this workflow, complete the setup below:\n\n1. Configure your AI Model credentials.\n2. Connect your Google account.\n3. Create the required Google Sheet.\n4. Update the Google Sheet in all Google Sheets nodes.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n6. Test using the Webhook Test URL.\n7. Once working, switch to the Production URL for website integration.",
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -160,
        -272
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a1640c2f-df1c-41e9-bbe4-b540be3a0b91",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🤖 AI Configuration\nThis workflow uses an OpenAI-compatible chat model.\n\nRecommended Model:\n• NVIDIA OpenAI Compatible Model\n\nRequired:\n\n• NVIDIA API Key\n• Base URL\n• Model Name\n\nUpdate the Chat Model node with your credentials before testing.\n\nAny OpenAI-compatible provider can also be used by updating the credentials.",
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        816,
        -288
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "d8d538e3-b30d-41ca-9f4f-e3c393b0279e",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "📊 Conversation Memory\nCreate a Google Sheet named:\n\nMessages\n\nRequired Columns:\n\n• ConversationId\n• role\n• messages\n• timestamp\n\nConnect your Google account and select this sheet in all Google Sheets nodes.\n\nThis sheet stores the complete conversation history and enables chatbot memory.",
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        384,
        -256
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "1fe76a7e-4a7a-4f07-8721-be44050c683f",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🌐 Webhook\nSend a POST request to the webhook.\n\nExample Request:\n\n{\n  \"conversationId\": \"abc123\",\n  \"message\": \"Hello\"\n}\n\nUse the same conversationId to continue an existing conversation.\n\nUse a different conversationId to start a new chat session.",
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -112,
        208
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "4e701972-6f95-4090-b695-16bf249ee04f",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "• Keep the same conversationId for memory.\n• A new conversationId starts a new chat.\n• Do not modify the Google Sheet column names.\n• Keep the Respond to Webhook node connected.\n• Make sure the Webhook Response Mode is:\n  \"Using Respond to Webhook Node\"",
        "color": 5
